From 54f6b2bf4bc27507bb21b0db8ec44311affb438f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TorrServerManager <noreply@torrservermanager.local>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 23:11:13 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 05/12] gstreamer: update and extend tests for the gate-based
 lock and segment leasing

Update call sites renamed from Task.mu to the gate helpers, and add
regression coverage: a lease copies out of the reader arena before it can be
recycled, the gate is free by the time LeaseSegment returns, and requests
cancelled while queued on the gate perform zero seeks.
---
 server/gstreamer/handlers_test.go     |   5 +-
 server/gstreamer/pipeline_gst_test.go | 112 +++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 112 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

